From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000034 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MC OS <mcos@local>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: rockchip: use BSP pm_domains driver

Linux 6.18 upstreamed Rockchip PM domains to drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/,
but the BSP driver in drivers/soc/rockchip/pm_domains.c is still required
for extended APIs (idle_request, qos, pd_on/off) used by MPP drivers.
Disable the upstream object to avoid duplicate symbol definitions.

Signed-off-by: MC OS <mcos@local>
---
 drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/Makefile b/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/Makefile
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/Makefile
@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
-obj-$(CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_PM_DOMAINS)	+= pm-domains.o
+# pm-domains.o: use drivers/soc/rockchip/pm_domains.c (BSP superset)
-- 
2.34.1
